# Local development (see docs/OPERATIONS.md → Local setup). Production uses a Neon pooled
# URL with ?sslmode=require. Destructive tests and scripts refuse to run unless
# this points at localhost — see lib/db-guard.ts.
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://houseladder:houseladder@localhost:55432/houseladder

# Shared house PIN (4 digits). Not authentication; it just keeps the
# deployment from being world-writable. It is only ever checked at /gate, which
# is rate limited (5 wrong tries per IP per 15 min, 20 wrong tries across all
# IPs per rolling 24h). Changing it signs out every device. Pick a different
# PIN for production.
HOUSE_PASSCODE=4821

# Signs the session cookie the gate issues (the cookie never holds the PIN).
# Required: without it nothing can sign in and every write fails closed. In
# production generate with `openssl rand -hex 32`, and never reuse this value.
AUTH_SECRET=local-dev-only-not-for-prod-auth-secret

# Bearer token for /api/cron/backup. In production generate with
# `openssl rand -hex 32` — the route fails closed (500) if this is unset.
CRON_SECRET=local-dev-only-not-for-prod

# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN is injected by Vercel once Blob storage is attached to
# the project. It is not needed locally and must not be pasted by hand.
